msgstr ""

#: src/Preflight/Rules/TotalsConsistency.php:80
msgid "Validators reject an invoice whose totals do not reconcile, even by one cent. This usually comes from an order-level discount, a coupon or a refund that is not represented on any line."
msgstr ""

#: src/Preflight/Rules/TotalsConsistency.php:81
msgid "Open the order and compare the line totals with the order total."
msgstr ""

